"after": "</p>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"peticao\" role=\"group\" aria-labelledby=\"fig1cap\"><h3>A inicial de Florinda · art. 319, inciso por inciso</h3><svg viewBox=\"0 0 840 926\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Petição inicial de Florinda contra Adamastor e Valquíria, marcada pelos incisos do art. 319: juízo, partes, fatos e fundamentos, pedidos, valor da causa de R$ 105.000,00, provas e audiência; a qualificação incompleta de Valquíria aparece como alvo de emenda (art. 321)\"><style>.a1-sheet{fill:var(--paper);stroke:var(--ink);stroke-width:1.5}.a1-tx{fill:var(--grid-major)}.a1-gap{fill:none;stroke:var(--conc);stroke-width:1.5;stroke-dasharray:5 4}.a1-box{fill:var(--paper);stroke:var(--ink);stroke-width:1.3}.a1-ink{stroke:var(--ink);stroke-width:1.2}.a1-br{fill:none;stroke-width:2}.a1-lead{fill:none;stroke:var(--conc);stroke-width:1.2;stroke-dasharray:4 3}.a1-cap{font:500 13.5px var(--serif);letter-spacing:.04em;fill:var(--ink)}.a1-h{font:500 11.5px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.09em;fill:var(--ink-2)}.a1-s{font:400 15px var(--serif);fill:var(--ink)}.a1-b{font:700 15px var(--serif);fill:var(--ink)}.a1-k{font:500 11px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;fill:var(--ink-2)}.a1-n{font:650 16px var(--sans);fill:var(--ink)}.a1-g{font:italic 400 14px var(--serif);fill:var(--ink-2)}</style><rect x=\"32\" y=\"28\" width=\"530\" height=\"892\" class=\"a1-sheet\"/><text x=\"50\" y=\"908\" class=\"a1-k\">anexos · procuração · documentos indispensáveis (art. 320)</text><rect x=\"20\" y=\"16\" width=\"530\" height=\"862\" class=\"a1-sheet\"/><text x=\"50\" y=\"58\" class=\"a1-cap\">EXCELENTÍSSIMO(A) SENHOR(A) JUIZ(A) DE DIREITO DA</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"69\" width=\"34\" height=\"7\" class=\"a1-tx\"/><text x=\"92\" y=\"78\" class=\"a1-cap\">VARA CÍVEL DA COMARCA DE</text><rect x=\"322\" y=\"69\" width=\"110\" height=\"7\" class=\"a1-tx\"/><text x=\"50\" y=\"132\" class=\"a1-b\">FLORINDA,</text><rect x=\"152\" y=\"123\" width=\"300\" height=\"7\" class=\"a1-tx\"/><rect x=\"50\" y=\"143\" width=\"150\" height=\"7\" class=\"a1-tx\"/><text x=\"210\" y=\"152\" class=\"a1-s\">vem propor ação em face de</text><text x=\"50\" y=\"172\" class=\"a1-b\">ADAMASTOR,</text><rect x=\"170\" y=\"163\" width=\"264\" height=\"7\" class=\"a1-tx\"/><text x=\"50\" y=\"192\" class=\"a1-b\">e de VALQUÍRIA,</text><rect x=\"182\" y=\"177\" width=\"338\" height=\"21\" class=\"a1-gap\"/><text x=\"192\" y=\"192\" class=\"a1-k\" style=\"fill:var(--conc)\">qualificação incompleta</text><text x=\"50\" y=\"246\" class=\"a1-h\">DOS FATOS E DOS FUNDAMENTOS JURÍDICOS</text><text x=\"50\" y=\"272\" class=\"a1-s\">1. A autora é fiadora em contrato de empréstimo de R$ 100.000,00,</text><text x=\"50\" y=\"292\" class=\"a1-s\">cuja nulidade sustenta perante Adamastor.</text><rect x=\"372\" y=\"283\" width=\"132\" height=\"7\" class=\"a1-tx\"/><rect x=\"50\" y=\"303\" width=\"454\" height=\"7\" class=\"a1-tx\"/><rect x=\"50\" y=\"323\" width=\"300\" height=\"7\" class=\"a1-tx\"/><text x=\"50\" y=\"358\" class=\"a1-s\">2. Valquíria espalhou boatos falsos que causaram à autora</text><text x=\"50\" y=\"378\" class=\"a1-s\">impacto moral.</text><rect x=\"166\" y=\"369\" width=\"338\" height=\"7\" class=\"a1-tx\"/><rect x=\"50\" y=\"389\" width=\"260\" height=\"7\" class=\"a1-tx\"/><text x=\"50\" y=\"452\" class=\"a1-h\">DOS PEDIDOS</text><text x=\"50\" y=\"478\" class=\"a1-s\">a) contra Adamastor: a declaração de nulidade do contrato</text><text x=\"68\" y=\"498\" class=\"a1-s\">de empréstimo, afastando a responsabilidade de fiadora;</text><text x=\"50\" y=\"522\" class=\"a1-s\">b) contra Valquíria: indenização por dano moral de</text><text x=\"68\" y=\"542\" class=\"a1-b\">R$ 5.000,00.</text><text x=\"50\" y=\"594\" class=\"a1-s\">Dá-se à causa o valor de</text><text x=\"222\" y=\"594\" class=\"a1-b\">R$ 105.000,00</text><text x=\"50\" y=\"614\" class=\"a1-s\">(R$ 100.000,00 do contrato + R$ 5.000,00 da indenização).</text><text x=\"50\" y=\"666\" class=\"a1-s\">Requer a produção das provas:</text><rect x=\"278\" y=\"657\" width=\"226\" height=\"7\" class=\"a1-tx\"/><rect x=\"50\" y=\"706\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" class=\"a1-box\"/><text x=\"72\" y=\"718\" class=\"a1-s\">tem interesse</text><rect x=\"220\" y=\"706\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" class=\"a1-box\"/><text x=\"242\" y=\"718\" class=\"a1-s\">não tem interesse</text><text x=\"50\" y=\"738\" class=\"a1-s\">na audiência de conciliação ou mediação.</text><text x=\"50\" y=\"784\" class=\"a1-s\">Nestes termos, pede deferimento.</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"795\" width=\"180\" height=\"7\" class=\"a1-tx\"/><line x1=\"320\" y1=\"844\" x2=\"520\" y2=\"844\" class=\"a1-ink\"/><text x=\"420\" y=\"862\" class=\"a1-k\" text-anchor=\"middle\">advogado(a) · oab</text><path d=\"M564 40H572V86H564\" class=\"a1-br\" style=\"stroke:var(--dif)\"/><text x=\"590\" y=\"54\" class=\"a1-k\" style=\"fill:var(--dif)\">art. 319, I</text><text x=\"590\" y=\"75\" class=\"a1-n\">o juízo</text><text x=\"590\" y=\"94\" class=\"a1-g\">a quem a demanda se dirige</text><path d=\"M564 114H572V200H564\" class=\"a1-br\" style=\"stroke:var(--dif)\"/><text x=\"590\" y=\"128\" class=\"a1-k\" style=\"fill:var(--dif)\">art. 319, II</text><text x=\"590\" y=\"149\" class=\"a1-n\">as partes</text><text x=\"590\" y=\"168\" class=\"a1-g\">quem pede, e contra quem</text><path d=\"M520 184H578L584 190\" class=\"a1-lead\"/><text x=\"590\" y=\"194\" class=\"a1-k\" style=\"fill:var(--conc)\">art. 321 · emenda</text><text x=\"590\" y=\"215\" class=\"a1-n\" style=\"fill:var(--conc)\">completar a qualificação</text><text x=\"590\" y=\"234\" class=\"a1-g\">o juiz aponta; 15 dias para emendar</text><path d=\"M564 228H572V406H564\" class=\"a1-br\" style=\"stroke:var(--dif)\"/><text x=\"590\" y=\"260\" class=\"a1-k\" style=\"fill:var(--dif)\">art. 319, III</text><text x=\"590\" y=\"281\" class=\"a1-n\">fatos e fundamentos</text><text x=\"590\" y=\"300\" class=\"a1-g\">a causa de pedir de cada pedido</text><path d=\"M564 434H572V550H564\" class=\"a1-br\" style=\"stroke:var(--dif)\"/><text x=\"590\" y=\"448\" class=\"a1-k\" style=\"fill:var(--dif)\">art. 319, IV</text><text x=\"590\" y=\"469\" class=\"a1-n\">o pedido</text><text x=\"590\" y=\"488\" class=\"a1-g\">o que se quer de cada réu</text><path d=\"M564 576H572V622H564\" class=\"a1-br\" style=\"stroke:var(--dif)\"/><text x=\"590\" y=\"590\" class=\"a1-k\" style=\"fill:var(--dif)\">art. 319, V</text><text x=\"590\" y=\"611\" class=\"a1-n\">o valor da causa</text><text x=\"590\" y=\"630\" class=\"a1-g\">a soma dos pedidos cumulados</text><path d=\"M564 648H572V674H564\" class=\"a1-br\" style=\"stroke:var(--dif)\"/><text x=\"590\" y=\"662\" class=\"a1-k\" style=\"fill:var(--dif)\">art. 319, VI</text><text x=\"590\" y=\"683\" class=\"a1-n\">as provas</text><text x=\"590\" y=\"702\" class=\"a1-g\">com que meios provará</text><path d=\"M564 700H572V746H564\" class=\"a1-br\" style=\"stroke:var(--dif)\"/><text x=\"590\" y=\"728\" class=\"a1-k\" style=\"fill:var(--dif)\">art. 319, VII</text><text x=\"590\" y=\"749\" class=\"a1-n\">a audiência</text><text x=\"590\" y=\"768\" class=\"a1-g\">a opção do autor, marcada ou não</text></svg><figcaption id=\"fig1cap\"><span>Fig. 1 "
},
